cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Misconception Detector for Processing (Java)"
abstract: >-
  Prototype web application for LLM-based detection of programming
  misconceptions in novice Processing code. A curated misconception catalog
  is embedded in the model prompt; detected misconceptions are returned with
  relevant code positions and explanations.
